    v1.7.0: Cache build progress/ETA, fix stop/close deadlock, UI polish
    
    - Add real-time cache build progress and ETA display during pre-build phase
    - Fix critical deadlock preventing stop/close during cache building (resume workers before signaling cancellation)
    - Fix worker thread hang on cache build failure (timeout pool.join)
    - Move cache help text to clickable ? button with bulleted list format
    - Make timelapse dropdowns white when active; cache mode dropdown white/grey by state
    - Auto-disable cache mode for non-Original video resolutions
    - Separate 'Cache Creation Progress' from 'Rendering Progress' with own ETA counters
    - Add CHANGELOG documenting recent fixes and improvements

